&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead complex engagements with matrixed teams (clinical, technical, and operational) on both the client side and within Qventus with minimal supervision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
