&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Concierge&lt;/strong&gt; team. Help shape our Perioperative Care Coordination solution that uses assistants to automate and streamline pre-admission testing workflows for hospital staff. It&#39;s designed to reduce the administrative burden on nurses and other healthcare workers so they can focus on patient care.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build scalable, intelligent systems that enhance the efficiency and reliability of these automated workflows. You’ll work cross-functionally with engineering and product to shape solutions that deliver measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role that will influence our platform, strengthen customer outcomes, and shape our company’s growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of workflows, hospital operations, and user needs to identify high-leverage opportunities that improve efficiency and reduce administrative burden for clinical staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers and product managements to define and refine product requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design, execution, and optimization of the Concierge product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with customers and stakeholders to validate concepts and gather feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a seamless user experience that balances simplicity, rigor, and delight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support cross-functional teammates across engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver and communicate a cohesive product vision that aligns with company goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+&lt;/strong&gt; years of experience in product engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in delivering engineering solutions in a fast-paced remote startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator with the ability to influence and collaborate across all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hands-on deep experience with distributed systems and Python&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Familiarity with AI-first agentic software development lifecycle&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker who balances big-picture vision with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for real-world impact and solving meaningful problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
